code: 0
--- stdout
Take the issue out of its sprint

  From:      any status
  To:        the status is not changed
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Sprint:    clears Sprint; an issue without one stays as it is

Usage:
  gh dojo unplan <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run   print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help      help for unplan
--- stderr
